3. Backbone weights downloaded by `trubeat fetch-models` (not in this repo)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The command downloads these from Hugging Face into the local cache when the
user runs it; the analysis itself never downloads anything.

timm/vit_small_patch14_dinov2.lvd142m
  DINOv2 ViT-S/14, Meta AI. Apache License 2.0. Used by aigen.joblib.
  M. Oquab et al., "DINOv2: Learning Robust Visual Features without
  Supervision", 2023 (arXiv:2304.07193).

timm/vit_base_patch16_clip_224.openai
  CLIP ViT-B/16, OpenAI. Released by OpenAI under the MIT License
  (openai/CLIP, Copyright (c) 2021 OpenAI); timm's copy is labelled
  Apache-2.0. OpenAI's model card, reproduced on timm's model page, says
  the model "is intended as a research output for research communities"
  and puts any deployed use case, commercial or not, out of scope. Used by
  faceswap.joblib.
  A. Radford et al., "Learning Transferable Visual Models From Natural
  Language Supervision", ICML 2021.


