AIGVDBench (Hugging Face dataset AIGVDBench/AIGVDBench)
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International:
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Training data of aigen.joblib; every clip was re-encoded to 360p
  (CRF 28) before features were taken, and no clip is redistributed. Its
  real clips are OpenVid-1M clips.
  L. Ma, Z. Xue et al., "Your One-Stop Solution for AI-Generated Video
